{"id":"51294837253ce8a7f189e0c14efb4c978cfde2d1","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246721","title":"学习 AI 量化，做股票分析的朋友看一下，太可怕了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"edp58162","excerpt":"问与答 - @edp58162 - 最近正在学习股票 AI 分析，用了 V2EX 的朋友写的 DSA ，对接的是阿里百炼平台里面的 qwen3.8问了 10 次，都是错的具体看一下图片吧，太郁闷了，这样的平台抓出来的","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>最近正在学习股票 AI 分析，用了 V2EX 的朋友写的 DSA ，对接的是阿里百炼平台里面的 qwen3.8</p><p>问了 10 次，都是错的</p><p>具体看一下图片吧，太郁闷了，这样的平台抓出来的数据还能相信吗？你们的也是这样吗？该怎样避免这个情况呢</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/OLNJH0v\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/OLNJH0v</a></p><p>[img]<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/28vpB1M.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/28vpB1M.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>[/img]</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/股票\"><li></li> 股票</a><a href=\"/tag/分析\"><li></li> 分析</a></P><p><span>19 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-07 19:16:01 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151259\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9f39f8cd478ef2a21d7a6c81949c0eb5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"testsb\" data-uid=\"187502\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/testsb\">testsb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 09:41:27 +08:00\">10h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>量化中一些简单的、直接查接口就能解决的数据，就别交给 AI 做了，不仅增加成本，还增加了不确定性</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151263\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4555/12c1/661756_normal.png?m=1767580261\" alt=\"june4\" data-uid=\"661756\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/june4\">june4</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 09:44:18 +08:00\">10h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是不是对 ai 有啥误会，ai 是高度有损压缩的知识，这类精细问题要外查才行。这问题问得象红楼梦第 10w 个字是什么</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151268\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f10a86fa2498cee23e727c57a1ba8e15?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"edp58162\" data-uid=\"657978\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edp58162\">edp58162</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 09:46:26 +08:00\">10h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是在软件里面直接给 ai 提问，问 ai 建议，软件结合提示词以后，结果回答的股票跟代码都对不上号，<br>我就直接到阿里百炼平台去问，结果更离谱，大家也是这样吗？这样的数据谁还敢用？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151271\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f10a86fa2498cee23e727c57a1ba8e15?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"edp58162\" data-uid=\"657978\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edp58162\">edp58162</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 09:51:16 +08:00\">10h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/june4\">june4</a> 好吧，也许是误会吧，可是，我感觉我的问题是贾宝玉是男的吧，这样也要先外查吗？这样压缩出来的还是知识吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151282\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eff4/53a7/313341_normal.png?m=1532421608\" alt=\"JinShu\" data-uid=\"313341\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JinShu\">JinShu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 09:58:58 +08:00\">10h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在 work 版本不都提供了券商 mcp 吗？ ai 顶多能搜集网上公开的数据，要准确还得是官方 mcp 才行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151366\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/84e41a23f65477d2c3c398dc13c8e053?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wnpllrzodiac\" data-uid=\"400264\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wnpllrzodiac\">wnpllrzodiac</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 11:02:14 +08:00\">9h 0m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>能赚钱还不收 vip ？<br>投入 10 产出 8 比较合理,<br>要是大于 10 能赚钱，ai 厂商为什么不自己跑，而要让你赚 2 ？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151375\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1788532163\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 11:06:27 +08:00\">8h 56m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>你是在体验中心玩模型，从对话内容看，模型并没有进行任何网络搜索，你这样用是不行的。我建议你别急着做这些具体的事情，先搞懂什么是 AI ，找个课程学一下，很多基本的概念你要懂。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151439\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ab2f/5982/181196_normal.png?m=1774324442\" alt=\"zackzeng\" data-uid=\"181196\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zackzeng\">zackzeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 11:37:36 +08:00\">8h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>7 楼的回复，楼主值得参考。 <br>大模型+工具 才能完成你的问题。单纯的大模型，那应该是 GPT 刚出的时候的玩法。就是一个查过期字典的用法。<br>1. 量化，最基础的一点，是有“数”，股票的历史数据，越详细，越实时越好。 这些数据获取一般都得付费，免费的不一定能达到你量化的要求。<br>2.如果你只是从数据里面找规律，那么大模型+数据，可以比较做问 “数”。<br>3.再深入一些的量化，实时数据做买卖决策，那大模型是帮你写代码，a.搭建数据通道，b.根据你需要做一些因子的计算。c 。连接你的交易所帮你下单。<br>所以，你这个标题 股票量化，你这样用。可能<br>1. 你不懂大模型<br>2. 你不懂量化</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151577\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8f5a/6c45/68150_normal.png?m=1790324226\" alt=\"jkjoke\" data-uid=\"68150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jkjoke\">jkjoke</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 13:00:47 +08:00\">7h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让 AI 回复明天买还是卖，胜率还要高一点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151778\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f49d/943e/456939_normal.png?m=1752458495\" alt=\"zsmile\" data-uid=\"456939\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zsmile\">zsmile</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 15:26:49 +08:00\">4h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果只是为了让大模型给结论，那其实数据比模型智能更重要，你可以考虑先如何拿到数据，或者接入同花顺一类的 mcp 服务</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151781\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f49d/943e/456939_normal.png?m=1752458495\" alt=\"zsmile\" data-uid=\"456939\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zsmile\">zsmile</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 15:27:43 +08:00\">4h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>另外如果你硬要这么直接问，那就用 deepseek 吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151846\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4b18/5cdc/238628_normal.png?m=1715387095\" alt=\"zons\" data-uid=\"238628\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zons\">zons</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 16:03:11 +08:00\">3h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这个跟量化没有任何关系吧。要分析就直接问 ai ，问谁不是问</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151854\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d922/259d/91010_normal.png?m=1535422005\" alt=\"cnrting\" data-uid=\"91010\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cnrting\">cnrting</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 16:11:44 +08:00\">3h 51m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 就是个垃圾总结器</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151908\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/83d2553e6fa77b01b5f7c72009dfae71?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"HENQIGUAI\" data-uid=\"195766\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HENQIGUAI\">HENQIGUAI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 16:40:06 +08:00\">3h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还不如用 Jev 判断多还是空，直接压大小</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151920\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eb19/e0af/547538_normal.png?m=1758629383\" alt=\"orion1\" data-uid=\"547538\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/orion1\">orion1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 16:45:13 +08:00\">3h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换 gpt 或者 claude ，应该会省好多事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151957\">\n        \